'''Tin Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] increases health, attack power and range, but also decreases movement speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]].

